* Proteus 8.13 adaptation of TI SLIM135A for the greenhouse node.
* Interface: OUT, PGND, VIN, GND. The project ties both returns together.
* The flattened network preserves the TI transient regulator core.
* Subcircuit parameters were resolved, ABM sources translated and PSpice
* voltage-controlled switches expressed as smooth conductances.
* The test bench includes a staged VIN/EN startup and a 330-ohm output load.
* Input/output capacitors and feedback follow the 3.3-V example (Fig. 28).
.MODEL D_D1 D( IS=1e-15 TT=10p Rs=0.05 N=.1  )
